[ti:One Heartbeat Away]
[ar:Giuntru]
[re:Automatic line alignment - listening review pending]
[00:00.00]I remember
[00:03.02]The feeling before the words
[00:06.92]The way the world grew quiet
[00:10.82]Just enough to be heard
[00:14.42]Like standing near the ocean
[00:18.60]Before the tide appears
[00:22.28]Knowing something beautiful
[00:26.44]Was already here
[00:29.98]There was a softness
[00:34.34]In the shape of every day
[00:37.58]As if life had stopped resisting
[00:41.52]And simply made a way
[00:45.64]Nothing needed proving
[00:49.16]Nothing needed change
[00:53.20]The stars stayed where they were
[00:56.58]Yet everything was rearranged
[01:00.40]We were one heartbeat away
[01:06.26]From becoming morning
[01:10.38]One heartbeat away
[01:14.00]From a thousand ordinary days
[01:19.08]And maybe that's the reason
[01:21.88]They still shine this way
[01:25.78]We were one heartbeat away
[01:30.32]One heartbeat away
[01:42.30]I remember
[01:42.82]How the future felt alive
[01:46.78]Like a light beyond the water
[01:50.86]Waiting with open eyes
[01:54.64]Every dream seemed weightless
[01:58.64]Every distance seemed small
[02:02.70]As if love had found a language
[02:06.52]Before speaking at all
[02:12.64]And sometimes
[02:13.58]When I close my eyes
[02:16.38]I still feel the air around us
[02:20.36]Wide as summer skies
[02:25.58]Not a promise
[02:29.06]Not forever
[02:30.90]Not something we could keep
[02:34.76]Just a door made out of wonder
[02:38.82]Opening quietly
[02:41.92]We were one heartbeat away
[02:46.12]From becoming morning
[02:50.22]One heartbeat away
[02:53.76]From a thousand ordinary days
[02:58.82]And maybe that's the reason
[03:01.68]They still shine this way
[03:05.58]We were one heartbeat away
[03:09.36]One heartbeat away
[03:14.78]If I leave you anything
[03:17.40]Let it be the feeling
[03:20.96]That the world became larger
[03:25.30]Whenever we were near
[03:28.70]That joy can be gentle
[03:33.38]That wonder can stay
[03:36.10]That love does not disappear
[03:40.76]It only changes shape
[03:44.22]We were one heartbeat away
[03:47.70]And somehow that was enough
[03:51.68]To fill an entire lifetime
[03:56.04]With more light than loss
[03:59.80]And if you think of me
[04:02.28]Don't think of goodbye
[04:04.42]Think of how brightly
[04:06.52]We were alive
[04:08.42]One heartbeat away
[04:23.84]One heartbeat away
[04:28.90]Still alive
[04:33.08]Inside the light
[04:36.86]
